  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers A2UI (Agent-to-User Interface), the declarative, streaming JSON protocol in which agents describe UI that renderers draw from a trusted component catalog. Version lines: A2UI v0.9 is current at its v0.9.1 patch (the repository's current production release), A2UI v1.0 is a release candidate built behind a flag, and A2UI v0.8 is legacy, with upgrade steps from v0.8 to v0.9 and from v0.9 to v1.0. All pins are files in the a2ui-project/a2ui repository at main 3db3b41 (2026-10-05), plus a2ui.org. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, the message envelopes, components and catalogs, data binding and actions, and transports and security.",
